          "title": "Fallbacks and Containing Cascading Failures",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Fallback",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Fallback = ==degraded but useful== answer when call fails or breaker is open",
                "Forms: cache, default, static content, simpler algorithm, queue for later"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Failure",
                "Fallback"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Recommendations down",
                  "Show popular items"
                ],
                [
                  "Pricing cache stale",
                  "Last known price + flag"
                ],
                [
                  "Primary read fails",
                  "Fail over to replica"
                ],
                [
                  "Payment write fails",
                  "Enqueue, tell user pending"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Fail fast, not silent",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Cheap==, local, tested",
                "Never call another fragile dependency",
                "Emit metric and alert whenever it fires"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Containment checklist",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Timeout on every call",
                "Capped retries, backoff, jitter",
                "Breaker + bulkhead per dependency",
                "Rate limit and load shedding at edge",
                "Fallback for non-critical features",
                "Degrade optional features first"
              ],
              "style": "checkbox"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Retry storm: no jitter, no budget",
                "Timeout longer than caller's",
                "One shared thread pool",
                "Breaker with no minimum call volume",
                "Untested fallback paths",
                "No chaos or load tests"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "text": "**Why alert on fallback?** Silent degradation hides the outage. **Why keep it local?** A fragile call fails too."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
